    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You have been trained in the use of armor-piercing rounds. Using two actions, you can modify your ammunition to gain the following features:</p><p>Hard alloy sabot rounds designed to penetrate ablative armor plating. These rounds add no bonus damage type.</p><p>When striking a target with an active Combat Armor Frame, 50% of the incoming HP damage bypasses the armor entirely and is dealt directly to shields and HP.</p><p>Remove this effect to return to standard ammunition.</p>"
